sory","factSourceTitle":"The Sweet Science of Candymaking","factSourceUrl":"https://www.acs.org/content/dam/acsorg/education/resources/highschool/chemmatters/archive/chemmatters-oct2014-candy-chem.pdf","factVerificationStatus":"expert_reviewed"},{"id":"pubchem-10975657","name":"Ribose","smiles":"C1C(C(C(C(O1)O)O)O)O","molecularWeight":150.13,"hbd":4,"recordType":"reference","position":{"x":-74.23,"y":-82.63,"z":116.98},"cid":10975657,"fact":"核糖藏在 RNA 和 ATP 裡，參與遺傳訊息與能量傳遞；煎肉時，它還會和胺基酸一起受熱，變出撲鼻的烤肉香。","factCategory":"biomedicine","factSourceTitle":"Understanding D-Ribose and Mitochondrial Function","factSourceUrl":"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC5959283/","factVerificationStatus":"expert_reviewed"},{"id":"pubchem-6036","name":"Galactose","smiles":"C(C1C(C(C(C(O1)O)O)O)O)O","molecularWeight":180.16,"hbd":5,"recordType":"reference","position":{"x":-66.7,"y":-83.31,"z":132.1},"cid":6036,"fact":"半乳糖的英文 galactose 把身世寫進名字裡：希臘文 galaktos 是「乳汁」，而牛奶中的乳糖分解後，就會釋出半乳糖。","factCategory":"history","factSourceTitle":"Galactose - an overview","factSourceUrl":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/topics/biochemistry-genetics-and-molecular-biology/galactose","factVerificationStatus":"expert_reviewed"},{"id":"pubchem-18950","name":"Mannose","smiles":"C(C1C(C(C(C(O1)O)O)O)O)O","molecularWeight":180.16,"hbd":5,"recordType":"reference","position":{"x":-67.24,"y":-84.58,"z":131.71},"cid":18950,"fact":"冰淇淋裡也可能藏著甘露糖：常見的關華豆膠以甘露糖串成主幹，少量就能讓冰淇淋更滑順、融得更慢。","factCategory":"food_sensory","factSourceTitle":"Application of guar (Cyamopsis tetragonoloba L.) gum in food technologies: A review of properties and mechanisms of action","factSourceUrl":"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC10494631/","factVerificationStatus":"expert_reviewed"},{"id":"pubchem-7427","name":"Trehalose","smiles":"C(C1C(C(C(C(O1)OC2C(C(C(C(O2)CO)O)O)O)O)O)O)O","molecularWeight":342.3,"hbd":8,"recordType":"reference","position":{"x":-69.63,"y":-80.03,"z":128.71},"cid":7427,"fact":"人類血液主要運送葡萄糖，昆蟲的體液卻以海藻糖為主；飛行時，酵素會把海藻糖分解成葡萄糖，替翅膀肌肉快速供能。","factCategory":"biomedicine","factSourceTitle":"Insect trehalase: physiological significance and potential applications","factSourceUrl":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/25429048/","factVerificationStatus":"expert_reviewed"},{"id":"pubchem-135191","name":"Xylose","smiles":"C1C(C(C(C(O1)O)O)O)O","molecularWeight":150.13,"hbd":4,"recordType":"reference","position":{"x":-73.16,"y":-81.19,"z":122.64},"cid":135191,"fact":"木糖真的和木頭有關：英文 xylose 源自希臘文 xylon（木材）；拆解木材、稻草或玉米芯的植物纖維，都能釋出木糖。","factCategory":"history","factSourceTitle":"Xylose - an overview","factSourceUrl":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/topics/biochemistry-genetics-and-molecular-biology/xylose","factVerificationStatus":"expert_reviewed"},{"id":"pubchem-439195","name":"Arabinose","smiles":"C1C(C(C(C(O1)O)O)O)O","molecularWeight":150.13,"hbd":4,"recordType":"reference","position":{"x":-66.4,"y":-78.15,"z":132.76},"cid":439195,"fact":"食品業會把阿拉伯糖加入含砂糖的飲料，當作砂糖的「煞車搭檔」；它會暫時牽制分解蔗糖的酵素，讓葡萄糖更慢進入血液。","factCategory":"uses","factSourceTitle":"Physiological Functions and Food Application of L-Arabinose","factSourceUrl":"https://www.jstage.jst.go.jp/article/oleoscience/13/9/13_429/_article","factVerificationStatus":"expert_reviewed"},{"id":"pubchem-439178","name":"Cellobiose","smiles":"C(C1C(C(C(C(O1)OC2C(OC(C(C2O)O)O)CO)O)O)O)O","molecularWeight":342.3,"hbd":8,"recordType":"reference","position":{"x":-64.66,"y":-98.51,"z":131.12},"cid":439178,"fact":"纖維二糖和麥芽糖都由兩個葡萄糖組成；人體能在小腸順利拆開麥芽糖，卻幾乎拆不開纖維二糖，只能把它送到大腸交給細菌發酵。","factCategory":"biomedicine","factSourceTitle":"Bioavailability of cellobiose by tolerance test and breath hydrogen excretion in humans","factSourceUrl":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/15561487/","factVerificationStatus":"expert_reviewed"},{"id":"pubchem-439242","name":"Raffinose","smiles":"C(C1C(C(C(C(O1)OCC2C(C(C(C(O2)OC3(C(C(C(O3)CO)O)O)CO)O)O)O)O)O)O)O","molecularWeight":504.4,"hbd":11,"recordType":"reference","position":{"x":-67.87,"y":-90.63,"z":126.12},"cid":439242,"fact":"黃豆、扁豆和鷹嘴豆都含有棉子糖；人體沒有拆解它的酵素，只能送進大腸給細菌發酵，產生的氣體正是吃豆後脹氣的原因之一。","factCategory":"food_sensory","factSourceTitle":"Raffinose Family Oligosaccharides: Friend or Foe for Human and Plant Health?","factSourceUrl":"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC8891438/","factVerificationStatus":"expert_reviewed"},{"id":"pubchem-17106","name":"Fucose","smiles":"CC1C(C(C(C(O1)O)O)O)O","molecularWeight":164.16,"hbd":4,"recordType":"reference","position":{"x":-71.81,"y":-90.47,"z":120.78},"cid":17106,"fact":"母乳裡含岩藻糖的寡糖，會讓病菌黏錯地方：會引起腹瀉的彎曲桿菌先黏上這些糖，就較難貼住嬰兒的腸道細胞。","factCategory":"biomedicine","factSourceTitle":"Structure-Function Relationships of Human Milk Oligosaccharides","factSourceUrl":"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3649474/","factVerificationStatus":"expert_reviewed"},{"id":"pubchem-25310","name":"Rhamnose","smiles":"CC1C(C(C(C(O1)O)O)O)O","molecularWeight":164.16,"hbd":4,"recordType":"reference","position":{"x":-64.22,"y":-79.3,"z":140.17},"cid":25310,"fact":"鼠李糖不是因為老鼠而得名：英文 rhamnose 來自鼠李屬植物 Rhamnus；這種灌木的果實曾被畫家製成綠色顏料，樹皮也能染出黃色。","factCategory":"history","factSourceTitle":"Rhamnose - an overview","factSourceUrl":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/topics/chemistry/rhamnose","factVerificationStatus":"expert_reviewed"},{"id":"pubchem-5460005","name":"Deoxyribose","smiles":"C(C=O)C(C(CO)O)O","molecularWeight":134.13,"hbd":3,"recordType":"reference","position":{"x":-67.31,"y":-70.88,"z":136.48},"cid":5460005,"fact":"DNA 裡的去氧核糖，竟能在模擬太空環境中出現：研究人員用紫外線照射模擬星際冰的水與甲醇，最後在殘留物中做出了它。","factCategory":"environment","factSourceTitle":"Deoxyribose and deoxysugar derivatives from photoprocessed astrophysical ice analogues and comparison to meteorites","factSourceUrl":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-018-07693-x","factVerificationStatus":"expert_reviewed"},{"id":"pubchem-439213","name":"Glucosamine","smiles":"C(C1C(C(C(C(O1)O)N)O)O)O","molecularWeight":179.17,"hbd":5,"recordType":"reference","position":{"x":-67.37,"y":-86.58,"z":133.78},"cid":439213,"fact":"許多葡萄糖胺保健品的原料起點其實是蝦蟹殼：工廠先從海鮮加工留下的硬殼取得甲殼素，再把它轉成葡萄糖胺。","factCategory":"uses","f